{"path":"/zh/patterns/r2-complexity-based-routing/cases/liangbo/","title":"R2 · 复杂度路由 · 东方屹腾执行型 Agent","blocks":[{"block_id":"adps-4ac371dada7a1afd-1","revision":"4ac371dada7a1afd6dc70032863a2b4466027a4ba4848dbd72d5ae08db387584","tag":"p","quote":"模式矩阵/R2 复杂度路由/蓝皮书"},{"block_id":"adps-5ddc984d300db52d-1","revision":"5ddc984d300db52d700ad8c00596d0925a417090e48f9398434e63ac8fc72407","tag":"table","quote":"字段 值 主模式 R2 复杂度路由 Complexity-Based Routing（推理 × 路由） 结合模式 P1 上下文分诊 · G1 审批门 案例 上海东方屹腾科技 · HR/薪酬 SaaS · 服务 2 万+ 企业 · 执行型 Agent 对应白皮书 /zh/patterns/r2-complexity-based-routing/ 源 梁博 AICon 逐字稿第三章 · PPT 第 9–12 页 工程结论 入口分类器把自然语言转换为有限控制信号，意图网关据此选择不同成本和风险的执行链。"},{"block_id":"adps-aed1dbb9ba4a32a9-1","revision":"aed1dbb9ba4a32a91a230d5f0c9b7ba335867ab4ca823a503608cc29f275f4d9","tag":"p","quote":"企业 HR 与薪酬入口会收到不同类型的请求：领域外闲聊、薪资表分析、薪资组配置、算薪或代发。若所有请求都进入链式推理和行动编排，简单请求会占用不必要的模型和工具成本，高风险事务也缺少独立治理入口。"},{"block_id":"adps-059afb53e0efcf92-1","revision":"059afb53e0efcf9231badfea48247ca0a01be5111bf81bf031784db815ec53c3","tag":"p","quote":"复杂度路由在主循环入口完成分类，并把请求分配到深度不同的执行链。"},{"block_id":"adps-97aa99b2548f45c1-1","revision":"97aa99b2548f45c165fb838f974c78a9a3d7d346b7549c22ef67bfb847d1b4b8","tag":"table","quote":"信号 下游处理 chat 固定答复或低成本对话 analyze 一次推理，必要时增加 RAG resolve 链式推理、行动或规划执行 unknown 澄清、拒绝或安全兜底"},{"block_id":"adps-eb579228251f34af-1","revision":"eb579228251f34afd05d4b7c4299d21c6a46bff3fee4cb23f15e59b52e2f4e52","tag":"p","quote":"随着场景增加，枚举演化为 task、information、produce、chat 等类型，并增加第二层业务场景绑定，用于推荐相关 Skill 和工具候选。枚举由下游流程倒推，不直接复用其他产品的分类。"},{"block_id":"adps-130a5a06b8cb4f9f-1","revision":"130a5a06b8cb4f9ff936edba32bfa28ee8d6b89ab5c81d04923674cd5e890d02","tag":"pre","quote":"用户输入 -> 受 Schema 约束的意图分类 -> 输出校验 -> 意图网关 -> chat / analyze / resolve / unknown 执行链"},{"block_id":"adps-effd786be3d16ed9-1","revision":"effd786be3d16ed9dbdcca49c759d613e83183bc044519b1d16faa44a5bf00de","tag":"p","quote":"分类器固定在一到两次模型调用内完成。输出必须符合 Schema，无法解析或置信度不足时转入 unknown。意图结论的自然语言摘要写入叙事状态，离散枚举进入控制平面。"},{"block_id":"adps-7d7f74f315e34e8f-1","revision":"7d7f74f315e34e8f6bb9226f8cb1b9fede36e4b0a65eeeb18b555dbb830d141d","tag":"p","quote":"会话仍保持 pre / middle / post 三段边界："},{"block_id":"adps-60cdca03c962c8a8-1","revision":"60cdca03c962c8a80ca04a499b2a1dc8114b9808b44608defbaf1b7126cd60b6","tag":"li","quote":"pre 接收输入并完成意图分类；"},{"block_id":"adps-31ce256ce4206ae8-1","revision":"31ce256ce4206ae8152f8ad624e1edfb96107399baeef1a3eb039695e19e9466","tag":"li","quote":"middle 执行所选能力链；"},{"block_id":"adps-8f23b2f186691743-1","revision":"8f23b2f186691743c3ff821317edc64837c99757f0f5e56eab1ce5e8dd95b50d","tag":"li","quote":"post 合成结果并返回。"},{"block_id":"adps-38fc52cde1646242-1","revision":"38fc52cde164624223b4fbde76bb570f60126729dcf9faa5ffae6bc3feeb9d9c","tag":"p","quote":"Orchestrator 管理三段流程，意图网关只负责从信号映射到执行链。"},{"block_id":"adps-78b22ab4a4445c06-1","revision":"78b22ab4a4445c06f3401a1dc042808d6f022b4b67f0cdb5b8135571d3499b3c","tag":"p","quote":"“你叫什么名字”可以在 chat 链路结束；上传薪资表并请求说明进入 analyze，按需检索领域知识；搭建薪资组进入 resolve，继续使用 R1 链式推理和行动模块。代发等敏感事务在后续控制信号中进入审批门。"},{"block_id":"adps-d998bf032ff7ef25-1","revision":"d998bf032ff7ef25c329b9f29b408d7d8a37e7d5f04e89e452013cece2ee055b","tag":"p","quote":"第二层场景绑定可以提前缩小 Skill 和工具候选，但不能跳过工具准入、参数校验和审批。"},{"block_id":"adps-ac900cf2315c85d0-1","revision":"ac900cf2315c85d00b8417d661b99fcc5ccebffc97130c9bdf6529a5d092e90f","tag":"li","quote":"分类结果是一段描述，没有离散枚举；"},{"block_id":"adps-d346278c369a508c-1","revision":"d346278c369a508cbfd5e785e0616fa5bd09dff178aceedce39696eb365fd8ef","tag":"li","quote":"未知输出直接进入默认重链路；"},{"block_id":"adps-79b2f0d882740d63-1","revision":"79b2f0d882740d634cb3af7f0be54890ec20a7fdc528e563c9f2c039f2e47feb","tag":"li","quote":"所有请求都被路由到最高成本路径；"},{"block_id":"adps-65b577ba8ff7425b-1","revision":"65b577ba8ff7425b99a03318d842c1d4bda4388ebd54949b30327bf314553419","tag":"li","quote":"枚举过细，入口分类承担了完整业务规划；"},{"block_id":"adps-8221ed74158a6170-1","revision":"8221ed74158a6170932715d57c63ffe57fcc8d6ce56be8a90af53c1ab884a0e3","tag":"li","quote":"业务分类和工具准入混为同一步；"},{"block_id":"adps-91cb618e8044a941-1","revision":"91cb618e8044a9417361ae763b00b9692e3e655b901173bc9343b492c8d8c6a4","tag":"li","quote":"路由结果没有进入事件时间线，无法分析误分流。"},{"block_id":"adps-88c5c13c07af59a4-1","revision":"88c5c13c07af59a4aa15caca49286269fc57c2a588bedf778a866f3e5c803333","tag":"li","quote":"Schema 解析成功率和 unknown 比例；"},{"block_id":"adps-fe879a8c907a6add-1","revision":"fe879a8c907a6addaa27e763bd165a86390f328718b5ab72f1d232389c017eda","tag":"li","quote":"chat、analyze 被误送入 resolve 的比例；"},{"block_id":"adps-cf12834211e30d99-1","revision":"cf12834211e30d99341dca60496bcd99a47c48a1bc869cd046e0d7017a6d87e0","tag":"li","quote":"事务请求被误送到轻链路的比例；"},{"block_id":"adps-ec9e774aa4e598c9-1","revision":"ec9e774aa4e598c99036cbe34a14d908c94efa0d4ce2bd69c7974ac371e3a66c","tag":"li","quote":"各档平均 Token、延迟和工具调用次数；"},{"block_id":"adps-efe68f4cb084e5ff-1","revision":"efe68f4cb084e5ffd18c10476a2efbf25d2ff8b10373ae0c4e94026d3202c7ce","tag":"li","quote":"二层场景绑定后的候选工具缩减率与正确率。"},{"block_id":"adps-ea47c236f14151e7-1","revision":"ea47c236f14151e7526b62cf3da47163dafc3da747e0c667a09de28e407eaf5f","tag":"p","quote":"R2 白皮书以信号提取、分类和分档执行描述复杂度路由。东方屹腾按动作类型和执行链深度分类，而非只按模型档位分类；unknown 承担解析失败和低置信度的回退。"},{"block_id":"adps-f061582e940c3eb5-1","revision":"f061582e940c3eb5bb2eb991e71c9dc061d28441a5188cd29d94abe354a4a3ba","tag":"p","quote":"自然语言入口对应多条成本、能力或风险差异明显的下游流程时，应使用复杂度路由。入口已经结构化，或所有请求使用同一流程时，可以直接进入主链。信号枚举、兜底和路由指标必须在上线前定义。"},{"block_id":"adps-b618b91cfc16b784-1","revision":"b618b91cfc16b78469fac6df741cf47a5e4310fadaa2b6cb601d09e523236524","tag":"p","quote":"引用建议：ADPS、梁博，《东方屹腾 · 复杂度路由》，企业 Agent 系统蓝皮书 v0.4，2026-08-02。"},{"block_id":"adps-07336cb1f093d306-1","revision":"07336cb1f093d306f9f6694518f0138fa9925bd53440f26b6e21d427504c348d","tag":"p","quote":"案例报告目录 · 模式目录 · CC BY 4.0"},{"block_id":"adps-79480e7125ad6903-1","revision":"79480e7125ad690354825fcdaaf560618dbc0f310b5df40f3f9e4ed205348fd8","tag":"p","quote":"证据边界：本页是完整案例的模式切片，记录特定系统约束下的实现选择。案例方提供的实现与效果信息未经过独立审计，不构成通用性能承诺。"},{"block_id":"adps-3c551855df185a69-1","revision":"3c551855df185a69bba5e6c436054cab73b1e5df7050f512e066b3f937c0e637","tag":"p","quote":"在 ADPS Chronicle 中查看"}]}
